  "title": "Kung Pao Brussels Sprouts",
  "description": "Liven up your roasted Brussels sprouts with a little POW, as in kung pao. The Asian sauce with rice vinegar, sambal oelek, and sherry pairs well with the Brussels sprouts.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
